Our level of indebtedness and significant debt service obligations could constrain our ability to invest in our business and make it more difficult for us to fund our operations.

We have substantial debt and substantial debt service obligations. At December 31, 2025, we had an aggregate principal amount of $45,000 of outstanding indebtedness, represented by the 13.5% Notes. In the future, we will need to raise additional funds. Commencing in June 2026, we will be required to commence making principal payments on the 13.5% Notes unless they are refinanced or amended.

